    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Prime Residential Development Site Full Planning for 21 Units\r\nKnock, Co. Mayo.\r\n\r\nFor Sale by Private Treaty\r\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present this exceptional residential development opportunity located within walking distance of Knock Shrine and Knock Village.\r\n\r\nThis prime site benefits from full planning permission for 21 mixed housing units, making it an ideal opportunity for builders and developers seeking a ready-to-commence scheme in a well-established and accessible location.\r\n\r\nPlanning Permission Granted For:\r\n14 x Two-Storey 3-Bedroom Terraced Houses\r\n2 x Three-Bedroom Single-Storey Terraced Houses\r\n2 x Three-Bedroom Single-Storey Semi-Detached Houses\r\n3 x Two-Bedroom Single-Storey Terraced Houses\r\nTotal: 21 Residential Units\r\n\r\nSite Features:\r\nPublic sewer connection available\r\nPublic water services on site\r\nElectricity & telecoms available\r\nWalking distance to Knock Shrine & village amenities\r\nStrong residential demand in the area\r\n\r\nDevelopment Contributions:\r\nDevelopment Cash Deposit: €84,000\r\nMayo Development Contribution Scheme: €63,000\r\nProvision for footpath/pedestrian connectivity: €55,650\r\n\r\nGuide Price: €450,000 O.N.O.\r\nThis is a turnkey development opportunity with planning secured ideal for immediate progression.\r\n\r\nFull planning pack, drawings, and maps available from sole agents.\r\n\r\n\r\n Disclaimer: These particulars, including measurements, floor areas and property size, are for guidance only and may contain errors. They are not part of any contract. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided\r\n\r\nContact:\r\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn MIPAV MMCEPI Auctioneers\r\n086 2130723 | 094 9362216\r\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD"
      },
      {
